@startuml SWProductionProcess-Page01

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Diagram: Sprint Start and Environment Provisioning
' Page 01 of SWProductionProcess-SprintLifecycle
' Source: SWProductionProcess-Page01-Instructions.md
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title <b><size:18>Sprint Start and Environment Provisioning</size></b>\n<i><size:12>One developer creates Sprint NNNN from stable worktrees and provisions local sprint infrastructure.</size></i>

left to right direction

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Skin / palette
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #444444
  TitleFontStyle bold
}

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #e1d5e7
  BorderColor #9673a6
  FontSize 11
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #f5f5f5
  BorderColor #666666
  FontSize 10
}

skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Swimlane 1 — Stable Inputs
' Style: stable/source  fillColor=#dae8fc strokeColor=#6c8ebf
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|"Stable Inputs"|

start

#dae8fc: <b>Stable worktrees</b>
under C:\Dropbox\whertzing\GitHub
<i>(ATAP.Utilities, _Planning, SharedVSCode,
and other repos discovered from TASKS.md)</i> ;

#dae8fc: <b>Overview.code-workspace</b>
Stable multi-root workspace
and branch/worktree matrix ;

#dae8fc: <b>TASKS.md</b>
in _Planning sprint worktree
<i>Repository markers drive downstream repo discovery</i> ;

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Swimlane 2 — Stage 1: Planning and SharedVSCode
' Automation nodes: fillColor=#e1d5e7  Manual: fillColor=#fff2cc
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|"Stage 1: Planning and SharedVSCode"|

#e1d5e7: <b>Run New-SprintStage1</b>
<i>Import-Module first; function definition file — no top-level execution on load</i> ;

#fff2cc: <b>Determine SprintNumber</b>
<i>Explicit parameter or latest retrospective</i> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Create SharedVSCode issue, branch, worktree</b>
Pattern: SharedVSCode-wt-&lt;issue&gt;-Sprint-&lt;NNNN&gt;-work-items ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Create _Planning issue, branch, worktree</b>
Pattern: _Planning-wt-&lt;issue&gt;-Sprint-&lt;NNNN&gt;-work-items ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Set-WorktreeJunctions for _Planning</b>
.claude, .github, .vscode
→ SharedVSCode sprint worktree ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Initialize _Planning from SharedVSCode sprint context</b>
Updates templateRef, hooksPath, commitTemplate ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Create sprint NuGet.config in SharedVSCode</b>
References all five ProGet feeds plus nuget.org ;

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Swimlane 3 — Stage 2: Repo Worktrees and Shared Context
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|"Stage 2: Repo Worktrees and Shared Context"|

#e1d5e7: <b>Run New-SprintStage2</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Parse TASKS.md for repo markers</b>
Exclude _Planning, SharedVSCode, and Cross-Repo ;

#f5f5f5: <b>For each downstream repo (loop)</b> ;

note right
  Loop iterates once per downstream repo
  identified in TASKS.md.
end note

#e1d5e7: <b>Create GitHub issue</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Fetch/pull stable branch</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Create sprint branch and worktree</b>
Pattern: &lt;repo&gt;-wt-&lt;issue&gt;-Sprint-&lt;NNNN&gt;-work-items
<i>Example: ATAP.Utilities-wt-100-Sprint-0007-work-items</i> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Set-WorktreeJunctions for repo</b>
.claude, .github, .vscode
→ SharedVSCode sprint worktree ;

note right
  Junctions are NTFS reparse points.
  Distinguish from plain file symlinks
  in audit and cleanup steps.
end note

#e1d5e7: <b>Initialize-DownstreamSprintFromSharedVSCode</b>
Updates workspace/shared context
in downstream repo ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Render Claude Code user settings</b>
SharedVSCode .ai/config/claudecode/settings.overlay.json
→ ~/.claude/settings.json real file ;

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' After Stage 2 the workspace-metadata and secrets/infra
' provisioning steps run in parallel (fork).
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

fork

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Swimlane 4 — Sprint Workspace Metadata
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|"Sprint Workspace Metadata"|

#e1d5e7: <b>Run New-OverviewSprintWorkspace</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Read Overview.code-workspace</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Rewrite folders to sprint worktrees when present</b> ;

#e1d5e7: <b>Set powershell.cwd to _Planning sprint worktree</b> ;

#d5e8d4: <b>Write OverviewSprintNNNN.code-workspace</b> ;

note right #f5f5f5
  Current cmdlet default.
  Rename label if approved convention becomes
  Overview-<SprintNNN>.code-workspace.
end note

#e1d5e7: <b>Add sprintEphemeral metadata</b>
sprintNumber, developerUsername,
BuildMaster base URL, ProGet base URL,
feed list, SQL instances,
Bitwarden secret names ;

fork again

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Swimlane 5 — Secrets, SQL Server, BuildMaster
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|"Secrets, SQL Server, BuildMaster"|

#e1d5e7: <b>Set-BuildMasterSprintVariables</b>
SprintNumber, UserName,
SprintBranchName per BuildMaster application ;

#f8cecc: <b>New-SprintBitwardenSecrets</b>
Creates 12 secure notes:
master, ATAPUtilities, AceCommander
x host/computer + localhost x Dev and Exp
Name form:
dbConnectionString-&lt;DB&gt;-&lt;Host&gt;-&lt;Dev|Exp&gt;-&lt;User&gt; ;

note right #f8cecc
  ⚠ Naming drift:
  Authoritative doc uses "Development" and "Experimental";
  implementation uses "Dev" and "Exp".
  Resolve before final diagram approval.
  (Doc says 8 secrets; implementation creates 12.)
end note

#e1d5e7: <b>New-SprintSqlServerInstances</b>
Creates Dev&lt;username&gt; and Exp&lt;username&gt;
(16-char SQL Server instance-name limit) ;

note right #f5f5f5
  Only Dev&lt;username&gt; and Exp&lt;username&gt;
  SQL instances are sprint-scoped.
end note

#e1d5e7: <b>Build-DatabaseWithFlyway</b>
Rebuilds ATAPUtilities and AceCommander
from scratch on each sprint instance ;

#dae8fc: <b>Permanent infrastructure reused</b>
ProGet feeds: permanent (no per-sprint feeds)
Permanent SQL: utat022\Integration,
  utat022\QA, utat022\Production
Permanent Bitwarden secrets for
  Integration/QA/Production (onboarding only) ;

note right #f8cecc
  No per-sprint ProGet feeds. Feeds are permanent.
end note

end fork

stop

@enduml
